This directory is intentionally tracked-but-empty.

If this repo is deployed by placing it at /ccagent on a turtle or host
computer, this is where /ccagent/jobs/ lands -- the operator's saved and
registered routines, plus jobs/index.json. .gitignore excludes both so a
clone never ships someone else's saved programs, but the directory itself
needs to exist for /save to work on a fresh checkout, hence this file.
